.env
.env.*
!.env.example
results/*
!results/README.md
!results/dataset_audit/
!results/dataset_audit/*.json
# F-04 remediation: append-only review histories and pre-write snapshots are
# provenance-essential; they must enter version control with the first anchor.
!results/dataset_audit/*.jsonl
!results/dataset_audit/snapshots/
# Writer lock (#17); never committed, a stale one is removed by hand.
results/dataset_audit/.review.lock
# Sanitized smoke summaries document provider preflight provenance; raw responses
# (none exist today) stay excluded.
!results/smoke_test/
results/smoke_test/**/responses*.jsonl
benchmark/runs/*
!benchmark/runs/README.md
!benchmark/runs/.gitignore
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.venv/

# Local deep-model handoff artifacts (bundles + prompts/reports)
gptpro-bundles/
gptpro/
